OCGRAPH 1
DOMAIN gameplay
# THE CONCRETE PLAYER CONTROLLER. The engine's built-in PlayerController is abstract and cannot be spawned, and begin_play
# possesses a pawn only when it has both. Input is read by the vehicle system and by AN_RallyRace, so nothing else belongs here.
NAME RallyController
DESCRIPTION The player controller. Empty on purpose: it exists so the game mode has something concrete to possess with.

CLASS AN_RallyController PlayerController

